b-6\"><a class=\"hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-amber-400 font-semibold tracking-wide\">International Partnerships</span></nav><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-4 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-700/50 backdrop-blur-md\"><div class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-amber-500 rounded-full\"></div><span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold text-amber-400\">GLOBAL ALLIANCES</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-light text-white tracking-tight mb-4 leading-tight\">International Partnerships &amp; Networks</h1><p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg max-w-2xl font-light leading-relaxed\">IRITAQ actively fosters collaborative academic frameworks, manuscript preservation programs, and research exchanges with elite global universities and institutions.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-16 pt-16 md:pt-20\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-emerald-700\"></span><span class=\"text-emerald-800 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">GLOBAL OUTREACH</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-4\">Bridging Scholarship Across Borders</h2><div class=\"space-y-4 text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\"><p>Our international connections form the backbone of IRITAQ&#x27;s global outreach, connecting specialized Qur&#x27;anic exegesis research with premier academic institutions worldwide.</p><p>Through joint fellowships, shared digital archives, and high-level symposia, these partnerships guarantee rigorous peer review, cross-cultural scholarly input, and preservation of rare manuscript heritage.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-16 pt-16 md:pt-20\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-emerald-700\"></span><span class=\"text-emerald-800 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">NETWORK</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800\">Partners</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-300 transition\"><div><div class=\"relative w-16 h-16 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 mb-6 flex items-center justify-center\"><img alt=\"University of Oxford\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Foxford.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Foxford.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Foxford.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Foxford.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Foxford.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Foxford.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Foxford.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Foxford.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Foxford.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-3\">University of Oxford</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Collaborative research framework focusing on Middle Eastern manuscripts, codicology, and comparative textual analysis of classical Tafsir works.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-slate-100\"><a href=\"https://www.ox.ac.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 transition\"><span>Know the partner</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-300 transition\"><div><div class=\"relative w-16 h-16 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 mb-6 flex items-center justify-center\"><img alt=\"Al-Azhar University\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Falazhar.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Falazhar.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Falazhar.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Falazhar.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Falazhar.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Falazhar.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Falazhar.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Falazhar.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Falazhar.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-3\">Al-Azhar University</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Strategic partnership on traditional Islamic jurisprudence, Arabic rhetoric studies, and joint certification of advanced Qur&#x27;anic sciences curricula.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-slate-100\"><a href=\"https://www.azhar.eg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 transition\"><span>Know the partner</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-300 transition\"><div><div class=\"relative w-16 h-16 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 mb-6 flex items-center justify-center\"><img alt=\"Cambridge Islamic College\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Fcambridge.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Fcambridge.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Fcambridge.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Fcambridge.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Fcambridge.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Fcambridge.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Fcambridge.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Fcambridge.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fpartners%2Fcambridge.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-3\">Cambridge Islamic College</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Joint academic symposia, faculty exchange initiatives, and modern digital humanities applications in textual Qur&#x27;anic databases.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-slate-100\"><a href=\"https://www.cambridgeislamiccollege.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 transition\"><span>Know the partner</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-16 pt-16 md:pt-20\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-emerald-700\"></span><span class=\"text-emerald-800 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">GALLERY</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-2\">Archives</h2><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm max-w-2xl\">Visual chronicles of partner-related events, delegations, and news updates.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"relative aspect-4/3 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group bg-slate-200 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\"><img alt=\"MOU signing ceremony with international visiting delegates.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farchives%2Farchive-1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farchives%2Farchive-1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farchives%2Farchive-1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farchives%2Farchive-1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farchives%2Farchive-1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farchives%2Farchive-1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farchives%2Farchive-1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farchives%2Farchive-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farchives%2Farchive-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity p-5 flex items-end\"><span class=\"text-white text-xs font-medium leading-snug\">MOU signing ceremony with international visiting delegates.</span></div></div><div class=\"relative aspect-4/3 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group bg-slate-200 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\"><img alt=\"Joint manuscript restoration workshop and paleography training session.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farchives%2Farchive-2.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farchives%2Farchive-2.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Farchive